---
description: Testing and evidence requirements
alwaysApply: true
---

A count, snapshot, screen, or happy path is not acceptance. Test positive and negative
paths, direct API access, invariants, deterministic generation, failure recovery, and phase
boundaries. Record commands, versions, exit codes, skips, warnings, and environmental limits.
Requirements: `PP-ACCEPT-001`, `PP-ACCEPT-003`, `PP-NFR-002`.
